+- **`afterModelResponse` now receives usage summed across every provider call in the turn, not only the final round.** For a turn that completed without tool calls the value is identical to before. For a turn that ran tool rounds, existing consumers will now record a larger number that covers the full cost of the turn — the increase is exactly what was previously uncounted. `undefined` is still passed when no round in the turn reported usage.
